    <bpmn:process id="W_W3937" name="W3937. AI Fairness, Bias Testing &amp; Non-Discrimination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Model build/validation (links to W3932); protected-class exposure
Frequency: Per model + periodic
Volume: Fairness testing of all rights/customer-affecting models
Owner: AI Governance / Responsible AI
Participants: AI Governance, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Model Risk (links to VS-21), Legal (links to VS-100), Privacy (links to VS-91), business AI owners (fraud VS-125, credit/financing VS-38, HR-adjacent VS-23/VS-19)
Source: workflow W3937 — AI Fairness, Bias Testing &amp; Non-Discrimination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3937_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3937_Lane1" name="AI Governance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3937_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3937_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3937_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3937_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3937_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3937_Start3" name="Model build/validation (links to W3932); protected-class exposure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3937_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3937_Task4" name="AI Governance/Data-Science define fairness metrics and protected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Data-Science define fairness metrics and protected attributes/proxies relevant to BuildRight (gender, age, region/income-proxy, mandatory-discount populations links to VS-85) per use-case: fraud-decline parity (links to VS-125), credit decision fairness (links to VS-38), pricing/promo fairness, LP/HR-adjacent model fairness (links to VS-23/VS-19)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Data Science / Legal
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model class</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3937_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3937_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3937_Task5" name="AI Governance/Data-Science run bias testing pre-deployment and in production…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/Data-Science run bias testing pre-deployment and in production (links to W3947), document disparities, and require mitigation (reweighting, threshold adjustment, feature removal) before approval
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Data Science / Model Risk
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3937_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3937_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3937_Task6" name="AI Governance/Legal document fairness outcomes for RA 10173/non-discrimination…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AI Governance/Legal document fairness outcomes for RA 10173/non-discrimination defense (links to VS-91/VS-22) and report fairness pass-rates to the AI steering and AI ethics review board (links to W3952)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Legal
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3937_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3937_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3937_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3937_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3937_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-615 (ensure controlled execution — Responsible AI — Fairness, Explainability, Privacy &amp; Safety (PA-128.2).) | - operational: bias testing and mitigation; operational: proxy analysis
Owner: AI Governance / Responsible AI</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3937_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3937_Annotation8" targetRef="W3937_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
