      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: AI adverse outcome / failure / breach
Frequency: Per incident + periodic review
Volume: ~dozens of AI incidents/yr (model failure, bias finding, hallucination harm)
Owner: AI Governance / Security
Participants: AI Governance, Security (links to VS-27.3), Privacy/DPO (links to VS-91), Legal (links to VS-100), business AI owners, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), CX (links to VS-13), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Corporate Affairs (links to VS-14.3)
Source: workflow W3943 — AI Incident Management &amp; Adverse-Outcome Response</bpmn:documentation>
