      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3943_Task4" name="AI Governance/Security triage and classify AI incidents (model failure, drift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Security triage and classify AI incidents (model failure, drift breach, bias/disparate impact, hallucination harm, adversarial attack, privacy breach via model — links to VS-91/W53), and activate response (disable/revert/fallback — links to W3940)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Security / Business Owners
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3943_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3943_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3943_Task5" name="AI Governance/Privacy/Legal assess reportability (RA 10173 data breach to NPC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/Privacy/Legal assess reportability (RA 10173 data breach to NPC if model exposed PII — links to VS-91, consumer harm — links to VS-22) and notify affected customers/regulators within timelines
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Privacy / Legal / Corp Affairs
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead / DPO
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3943_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3943_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3943_Task6" name="AI Governance run post-incident review (root cause links to W3947), remediate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AI Governance run post-incident review (root cause links to W3947), remediate (model fix, control, policy), and capture learning to prevent recurrence, reporting material incidents to the Audit Committee (links to VS-21/VS-36)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Model Risk / Audit
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3943_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3943_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3943_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3943_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
