        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-615 (ensure controlled execution — Responsible AI — Fairness, Explainability, Privacy &amp; Safety (PA-128.2).) | - operational: monitoring (links to W3947) and incident reporting; operational: triage protocol
Owner: AI Governance / Security</bpmn:text>
